language sdl-mvp1-exercise version 0.1.

scenario RecoverCommand.
condition RecoverCommandReady.
condition RecoverCommandContinue.
condition RecoverCommandReject.
outcome RecoverCommandCompleted.
outcome RecoverCommandRejected.
step RecoverCommandLookup.
step RecoverCommandServer.
step RecoverCommandObserve.
step RecoverCommandFailure.
step RecoverCommandSuccess.

condition CommandKnown.
condition CommandStillUnknown.
condition CommandConflictOrExpired.
step RetainUnknownCommand.
step RejectInvalidRetry.
outcome CommandOutcomeUnknown.
outcome InvalidRetryRejected.

RecoverCommand illustrates RecoverUncertainAction.
RecoverCommand exercises CorrelatedUiCommands.
RecoverCommand starts-when RecoverCommandReady.
RecoverCommand starts-at RecoverCommandLookup.
RecoverCommandReady describes "A submitted command's transport outcome is ambiguous.".
RecoverCommandContinue describes "The previous operation succeeded and the next step's declared contract preconditions remain true; exact predicates are an executable-language gap.".
RecoverCommandReject describes "Validation, authority, applicability or operation failure prevents continuation; preserve prior valid state and report the specific reason.".
RecoverCommandCompleted describes "The stated design path completed under its explicit obligations; this is not an observed test result.".
RecoverCommandRejected describes "The path terminated without claiming the requested change succeeded; failures remain observable.".
RecoverCommand preserves StableCommandIdentity.
RecoverCommand preserves ServerBoundAuthority.
RecoverCommandLookup calls RecoverUiCommand within BuckingUI.
RecoverCommandLookup describes "Retain ID; lookup/same-payload retry only within advertised lifecycle.".
RecoverCommandLookup proceeds-to RecoverCommandFailure when RecoverCommandReject.
RecoverCommandLookup proceeds-to RecoverCommandServer when RecoverCommandContinue.
RecoverCommandServer calls RecoverCommandLifecycle within MachineService.
RecoverCommandServer describes "Known result is replayed, conflict rejected, expired/unknown not silently executed.".
RecoverCommandServer proceeds-to RecoverCommandObserve when CommandKnown.
RecoverCommandObserve calls ReconcileUiCommandResult within BuckingUI.
RecoverCommandObserve describes "Update observed lifecycle; timeout is not cancellation.".
RecoverCommandObserve proceeds-to RecoverCommandFailure when RecoverCommandReject.
RecoverCommandObserve proceeds-to RecoverCommandSuccess when RecoverCommandContinue.
RecoverCommandFailure finishes RecoverCommand with RecoverCommandRejected.
RecoverCommandSuccess finishes RecoverCommand with RecoverCommandCompleted.
CommandKnown describes "Lookup or same-ID replay supplies a retained authoritative lifecycle result.".
CommandStillUnknown describes "No authoritative outcome yet; keep the original ID and explicit unknown state. Recovery wait/deadline policy remains required.".
CommandConflictOrExpired describes "Owner reports same-ID/different-payload conflict or expired ID; do not execute it as a fresh retry.".
RecoverCommandServer proceeds-to RetainUnknownCommand when CommandStillUnknown.
RecoverCommandServer proceeds-to RejectInvalidRetry when CommandConflictOrExpired.
RetainUnknownCommand finishes RecoverCommand with CommandOutcomeUnknown.
RejectInvalidRetry finishes RecoverCommand with InvalidRetryRejected.
CommandOutcomeUnknown describes "No success, cancellation or safe re-execution is inferred.".
InvalidRetryRejected describes "Conflict/expiry surfaced to initiating context; a deliberate new action is a separate request.".
